<item><title>Madagascar allows accused woman escorted visits to hospitalised baby</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-allows-accused-woman-escorted-visits-to-3c1fae/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-allows-accused-woman-escorted-visits-to-3c1fae/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>Mendrika Nasandratriniony remains in detention after a court rejected her release request, but can visit her child under prison escort.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 04:30:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" length="36472" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Miara Manorina proposes Madagascar plan through 2060</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/miara-manorina-proposes-madagascar-plan-through-2060-ad211d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/miara-manorina-proposes-madagascar-plan-through-2060-ad211d/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>The movement sets growth targets of at least 6% from 2027 to 2032, about 9% from 2033 to 2045 and 10% from 2046 to 2060.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" length="36472" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Russia supplies Madagascar with 230 digital medical devices</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/russia-supplies-madagascar-with-230-digital-medical-devices-4686c8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/russia-supplies-madagascar-with-230-digital-medical-devices-4686c8/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>The equipment, provided by Russian bank Sberbank, can run tests offline and use artificial intelligence to suggest three possible diagnoses.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" length="36472" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
